@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber
participant User
participant DatabaseSystem
participant BlockchainNetwork

User->>DatabaseSystem: Select Database
activate DatabaseSystem

User->>DatabaseSystem: Choose Blockchain Implementation
User->>DatabaseSystem: Configure Blockchain Network Settings
User->>DatabaseSystem: Map Database Schema to Blockchain Structure

DatabaseSystem->>DatabaseSystem: Validate Blockchain Configuration

alt Configuration Valid
    DatabaseSystem->>BlockchainNetwork: Integrate Database
    DatabaseSystem->>User: Success Message
else
    DatabaseSystem->>User: Error Message
end

deactivate DatabaseSystem
@enduml